      <h2 id="zero-trust-manager-install-console_zero-trust-manager-install" class="group scroll-mt-20">Installing the Zero Trust Workload Identity Manager by using the web console<a href="#zero-trust-manager-install-console_zero-trust-manager-install" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Use the Software Catalog in the OpenShift Container Platform web console to install the Zero Trust Workload Identity Manager. This process streamlines deployment and helps ensure the Operator is installed in the correct namespace with the appropriate installation mode.</p>
