      <p class="_abstract">Install the Zero Trust Workload Identity Manager by using the command-line interface (CLI) to create the required project, <code>OperatorGroup</code>, and <code>Subscription</code> objects. You can then deploy the Operator components necessary for managing workload identities on your OpenShift Container Platform cluster.</p>
